{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced Entry is a realistic horror escape sim. Survive a night of terror inside a dark house with a maniac roaming the hallways hunting for you. He has barricaded the exits and set traps around the house.<br><br>You<strong> MUST</strong>\u00a0stay as quiet as possible he is listening for any noises if he hears anything you will only have moments to hide if your lucky.<br><br>- AVOID creaking floorboards they will alert him to your location.<br>- Use tools and other objects inside the house to try escape the maniac before its too late.<br>- Discover hidden areas inside the house\u00a0<br>- Stick to the shadows to avoid being spotted the killer is fast and will show you no mercy.<br>- Find and help your friends who have been captured and injured by the masked intruder.\u00a0<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/913cb6a67e0e3fcbef1b6ca1cad95e8c.avif?t=1753378053\" width=800 height=1200 /></span><strong>The maniac has made sure you cant escape him easily you will need to use the tools you find to progress through the house.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/42d0a5a318067c24e07ea535f8846d83.poster.avif?t=1753378053\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/42d0a5a318067c24e07ea535f8846d83.webm?t=1753378053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/42d0a5a318067c24e07ea535f8846d83.mp4?t=1753378053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Does the house itself hold a dark secret that will help unmask the identity of who the blood hungry butcher is?\u00a0</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl